OL,3,GNEWSACarers charity to close after
OL,4,Acouncil contract withdrawn
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey charity which supports unpaid
OL,7,Fcarers says it will close after 40
OL,8,Fyears as it is "no longer financially
OL,9,Fviable to continue" after its contract
OL,10,Fwith the county council was terminated.
OL,12,FCrossroads Care Surrey said it would
OL,13,Fshut on 30 November as its finances had
OL,14,Fbecome "unsustainable".
OL,16,FThe charity, based in Leatherhead, said
OL,17,Fthe decision came after its contract to
OL,18,Fprovide services for Surrey County
OL,19,FCouncil (SCC) was terminated in March.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
