OL,3,GNEWSACarers charity to close after
OL,4,Acouncil contract withdrawn
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn SCC spokesperson said the decision
OL,7,Fto end contracts "wasn't taken
OL,8,Flightly", but that it had "a
OL,9,Fresponsibility to make sure that public
OL,10,Ffunds are directed towards services
OL,11,Fwhich deliver the greatest benefit for
OL,12,FSurrey residents".
